---
const points = ['Confirman o cancelan su cita', 'Piden cambiar de horario', 'Revisan su presupuesto y saldo', 'Reciben avisos de sus citas'];
---
<section class="section wrap" id="portal">
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="copy" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">Portal del paciente</p>
      <h2 class="h-display">Tus pacientes<br />también lo usan.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Desde su celular, sin llamar a la clínica. Con tu logo y tus colores.</p>
      <ul>{points.map((p) => <li>{p}</li>)}</ul>
    </div>

    <div class="phone-wrap" data-reveal aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="phone">
        <div class="brandbar"><span class="logo">CS</span><div><strong>Clínica Sonrisa</strong><small>Portal del paciente</small></div></div>
        <div class="next">
          <span class="dt-card-eyebrow">Tu próxima cita</span>
          <strong>Martes 30 · 10:30</strong>
          <small>Limpieza dental · Dra. Ruiz</small>
          <div class="actions"><span class="dt-btn dt-btn-brand dt-btn-sm">Confirmar</span><span class="dt-btn dt-btn-secondary dt-btn-sm">Reprogramar</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="row"><span>Presupuesto</span><b class="dt-num">$3,200</b></div>
        <div class="row"><span>Pagado</span><b class="dt-num">$2,000</b></div>
        <div class="row tot"><span>Saldo pendiente</span><b class="dt-num">$1,200</b></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr; gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px); align-items: center; }
  .copy { text-align: left; }
  .copy .lead { margin-left: 0; }
  ul { list-style: none; margin: 32px 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 14px; }
  li { display: flex; gap: 12px; font: 500 17px/1.4 var(--font-sans); }
  li::before { content: ""; flex: none; width: 16px; height: 16px; margin-top: 3px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--brand); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 5px var(--brand-soft); }
  .phone-wrap { display: flex; justify-content: center; padding: 32px 0; border-radius: var(--radius-xl); background: var(--brand-soft); }
  .phone { width: min(300px, 86%); padding: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; border-radius: 32px; background: var(--surface-raised); box-shadow: var(--shadow-float); }
  .brandbar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 4px 4px 8px; }
  .logo { width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--brand); color: var(--on-brand); display: grid; place-items: center; font: 600 13px/1 var(--font-sans); }
  .brandbar strong { display: block; font: 600 15px/1.2 var(--font-sans); }
  .brandbar small { display: block; font: 500 12px/1.2 var(--font-sans); color: var(--ink-muted); }
  .next { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; padding: 14px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--surface-sunken); }
  .next strong { font: 600 19px/1.2 var(--font-sans); letter-spacing: -0.015em; }
  .next small { font: 500 13px/1.3 var(--font-sans); color: var(--ink-muted); }
  .actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 10px; }
  .row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 6px 4px; font: 500 14px/1.2 var(--font-sans); color: var(--ink-muted); }
  .row b { color: var(--ink); }
  .row.tot { padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline); color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
